# Cursor Rules — Codex Nothing

> **Start here:** Read `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — it has copy-paste widget templates, all CSS tokens, typography rules, and concrete code examples. This file is a quick reference; DESIGN_SYSTEM.md is the full guide.

## Project
- React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind CSS v4.2.2
- Nothing OS design: black/white/red only
- 52 widgets in `src/design/widgets/`

## Non-negotiable Rules
1. **Container queries only** — `@min-[300px]:`, never `md:` or `lg:`
2. **Tokens only** — `var(--surface-2)`, never `#1e1e1e`
3. **Doto font restricted** — clocks, counters, short metrics only
4. **No gradients, no decorative shadows**
5. **Red only for alerts/status/active**

## Creating a Widget (checklist)
- [ ] Copy template from `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`
- [ ] Use `Tile` + `useWidgetTheme()`
- [ ] Use container queries for responsive sizing
- [ ] Register in `WidgetRegistry.tsx`
- [ ] Add demo to `NothingPlaygroundPage.tsx`
- [ ] Run `npm run lint && npm run build`

## File Map
```
DESIGN_SYSTEM.md          ← START HERE (examples + tokens)
src/design/primitives/    ← Tile, Label, DotText, IconButton
src/design/widgets/       ← 52 existing widgets (reference)
src/components/WidgetRegistry.tsx  ← Register widgets
src/pages/NothingPlaygroundPage.tsx ← Add demos
```
